  zx32 rldicl        M_ORIG (the defect verbatim)       destination: 0xcafef00d vs 0x0
                     M_NAIVE (delete the AND)           0xcafef00d vs 0xdeadbeefffffffff
  rot8 rldicl        the same, on a pure rotate         a rotate whose mask is all-ones,
                                                        so it separates the ROTATE from
                                                        the MASK
